<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Pyxie Sazonal • Painel de Eventos da Cringelândia</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="https://cdn.discordapp.com/emojis/1548444149785694238.gif" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@400;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg-main: #07040e;
        --bg-card: rgba(18, 10, 34, 0.94);
        --bg-card-hover: rgba(26, 15, 48, 0.98);
        --purple-accent: #8b5cf6;
        --purple-glow: #c084fc;
        --pink-neon: #f43f5e;
        --pink-bright: #ec4899;
        --cyan-neon: #38bdf8;
        --green-neon: #10b981;
        --yellow-neon: #fbbf24;
        --red-neon: #ef4444;
        --text-white: #ffffff;
        --text-muted: #94a3b8;
        --border-glass: rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.22);
      }

      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        background-color: var(--bg-main);
        background-image: 
          radial-gradient(circle at top right, #2b0f4c 0%, #07040e 100%),
          radial-gradient(circle at 10% 40%, rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.09) 0%, transparent 40%),
          radial-gradient(circle at 90% 70%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.09) 0%, transparent 40%);
        color: var(--text-white);
        min-height: 100vh;
        padding: 20px 16px 40px;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 1280px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .topbar {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        background: var(--bg-card);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 16px 24px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      }

      .brand {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 14px;
      }

      .brand-icon {
        font-size: 28px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--purple-accent), var(--pink-neon));
        width: 48px;
        height: 48px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.4);
      }

      .brand-title h1 {
        font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
        font-size: 1.35rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        background: linear-gradient(to right, #ffffff, var(--purple-glow));
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      }

      .brand-title p {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
      }

      .top-actions {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        padding: 10px 18px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: all 0.2s ease;
        text-decoration: none;
        border: 1px solid transparent;
      }

      .btn-secondary {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
        color: var(--text-white);
        border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      }

      .btn-secondary:hover {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      }

      .btn-primary {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--purple-accent), var(--pink-bright));
        color: #fff;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4);
      }

      .btn-primary:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.6);
      }

      .btn-danger {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ef4444, #b91c1c);
        color: #fff;
      }

      .btn-danger:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4);
      }

      .btn-success {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669);
        color: #fff;
      }

      .btn-success:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);
      }

      .status-pill {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        padding: 6px 14px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      }

      .status-pill.active {
        background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
        color: var(--green-neon);
        border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);
      }

      .status-pill.inactive {
        background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15);
        color: var(--red-neon);
        border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4);
      }

      .status-dot {
        width: 8px;
        height: 8px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: currentColor;
      }

      /* Layout Grid */
      .main-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
        gap: 24px;
      }

      @media (max-width: 1024px) {
        .main-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
      }

      .card {
        background: var(--bg-card);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
        border-radius: 18px;
        padding: 24px;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }

      .card-header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        padding-bottom: 12px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      }

      .card-header h2 {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        color: var(--purple-glow);
      }

      .form-group {
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .form-row {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      label {
        display: block;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }

      input[type="text"],
      input[type="datetime-local"],
      textarea,
      select {
        width: 100%;
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 10px 14px;
        color: #fff;
        font-family: inherit;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        transition: all 0.2s;
      }

      input:focus,
      textarea:focus,
      select:focus {
        outline: none;
        border-color: var(--purple-accent);
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
      }

      textarea {
        resize: vertical;
        min-height: 80px;
      }

      .help-text {
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        margin-top: 4px;
      }

      /* Live Discord Embed Preview */
      .discord-preview-box {
        background: #2b2d31;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 16px;
        font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        border-left: 4px solid #7c3aed;
        margin-top: 14px;
      }

      .preview-author {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .preview-avatar {
        width: 24px;
        height: 24px;
        border-radius: 50%;
      }

      .preview-author-name {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #f2f3f5;
      }

      .preview-title {
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #ffffff;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .preview-desc {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: #dbdee1;
        line-height: 1.4;
        white-space: pre-wrap;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      .preview-img {
        max-width: 100%;
        max-height: 220px;
        object-fit: cover;
        border-radius: 6px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        display: block;
      }

      .preview-fields {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 10px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      .preview-field {
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
        border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 8px 12px;
        border-left: 3px solid var(--purple-accent);
      }

      .preview-field-title {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #f2f3f5;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
      }

      .preview-field-val {
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        color: #dbdee1;
        line-height: 1.45;
        white-space: pre-wrap;
      }

      .preview-footer {
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        color: #949ba4;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        padding-top: 8px;
      }

      .tab-buttons {
        display: flex;
        gap: 8px;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
      }

      .tab-btn {
        padding: 6px 14px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        color: var(--text-muted);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .tab-btn.active {
        background: var(--purple-accent);
        color: #fff;
        border-color: var(--purple-accent);
      }

      /* Visual Emoji Slots & Chips */
      .visual-emoji-slot {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 14px;
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 10px 14px;
        margin-top: 6px;
      }

      .slot-preview {
        width: 44px;
        height: 44px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-size: 26px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        overflow: hidden;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .slot-preview img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: contain;
      }

      .slot-details {
        flex: 1;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .slot-name {
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #fff;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
        white-space: nowrap;
        overflow: hidden;
        text-overflow: ellipsis;
      }

      .slot-id {
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-family: monospace;
      }

      .visual-chips-container {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 8px;
        min-height: 46px;
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        border: 1px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 8px 12px;
        align-items: center;
        margin-top: 6px;
      }

      .emoji-chip {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 7px;
        background: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.22);
        border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.35);
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 4px 10px;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: #f1f5f9;
        transition: all 0.2s ease;
      }

      .emoji-chip:hover {
        background: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.38);
        border-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.6);
      }

      .emoji-chip img {
        width: 22px;
        height: 22px;
        object-fit: contain;
      }

      .emoji-chip .btn-remove-chip {
        background: none;
        border: none;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
        cursor: pointer;
        font-size: 13px;
        padding: 0 2px;
        line-height: 1;
        transition: color 0.15s;
      }

      .emoji-chip .btn-remove-chip:hover {
        color: #ef4444;
      }

      .badge-count {
        background: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.25);
        color: var(--purple-glow);
        border: 1px solid rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.45);
        padding: 2px 9px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      /* Modal Visual de Emojis */
      .emoji-modal-backdrop {
        display: none;
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.82);
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        z-index: 99999;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 16px;
      }

      .emoji-modal-content {
        max-width: 760px;
        width: 100%;
        max-height: 85vh;
        background: #110920;
        border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.45);
        border-radius: 20px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        box-shadow: 0 25px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95);
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .emoji-modal-header {
        padding: 18px 24px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2);
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .emoji-modal-header h3 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        color: #ec4899;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
      }

      .emoji-modal-header p {
        margin: 2px 0 0 0;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        color: #94a3b8;
      }

      .emoji-modal-controls {
        padding: 12px 20px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
        display: flex;
        gap: 10px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: center;
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      }

      .emoji-modal-search {
        flex: 1;
        min-width: 220px;
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.35);
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 8px 12px;
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        outline: none;
      }

      .emoji-modal-search:focus {
        border-color: var(--purple-accent);
      }

      .picker-filter-btn {
        padding: 6px 12px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        color: var(--text-muted);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: all 0.15s;
      }

      .picker-filter-btn:hover {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        color: #fff;
      }

      .picker-filter-btn.active {
        background: var(--purple-accent);
        color: #fff;
        border-color: var(--purple-accent);
      }

      .emoji-grid-box {
        flex: 1;
        overflow-y: auto;
        padding: 16px 20px;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(78px, 1fr));
        gap: 10px;
        max-height: 52vh;
      }

      .emoji-picker-card {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 8px 4px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: all 0.15s ease;
        position: relative;
      }

      .emoji-picker-card:hover {
        background: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.35);
        border-color: var(--purple-accent);
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.35);
      }

      .emoji-picker-card img {
        width: 36px;
        height: 36px;
        object-fit: contain;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
      }

      .emoji-picker-card .emoji-picker-name {
        font-size: 0.65rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 90%;
        overflow: hidden;
        text-overflow: ellipsis;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }

      .emoji-picker-card .anim-tag {
        position: absolute;
        top: 3px;
        right: 3px;
        background: #ec4899;
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 0.55rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        padding: 1px 3px;
        border-radius: 4px;
      }

      .emoji-modal-footer {
        padding: 12px 20px;
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
      }

      /* Toast Notification */
      #toast {
        position: fixed;
        bottom: 24px;
        right: 24px;
        padding: 12px 20px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        display: none;
        z-index: 9999;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
      }

      #toast.success {
        background: #059669;
        color: #fff;
      }

      #toast.error {
        background: #dc2626;
        color: #fff;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <!-- Top Navbar -->
      <div class="topbar">
        <div class="brand">
          <div class="brand-icon">🎃</div>
          <div class="brand-title">
            <h1>Pyxie Sazonal • Cringelândia</h1>
            <p>Gerenciamento Desacoplado de Eventos e Competições</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="top-actions">
          <div id="statusBadge" class="status-pill <%= active ? 'active' : 'inactive' %>">
            <span class="status-dot"></span>
            <span id="statusText"><%= active ? 'Evento Ativo' : 'Evento Desligado' %></span>
          </div>

          <a href="/admin" class="btn btn-secondary">
            ⬅️ Voltar ao Painel
          </a>

          <% if (active) { %>
            <button id="toggleBtn" class="btn btn-danger" onclick="toggleEvent(false)">
              🛑 Encerrar Evento
            </button>
          <% } else { %>
            <button id="toggleBtn" class="btn btn-success" onclick="toggleEvent(true)">
              🚀 Iniciar Evento
            </button>
          <% } %>

          <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="saveConfiguration()">
            💾 Salvar Alterações
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Layout -->
      <div class="main-grid">
        <!-- Coluna Esquerda: Formulário de Configurações -->
        <div class="left-col">
          <!-- Configurações Gerais -->
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-header">
              <h2>⚙️ Configurações Principais</h2>
              <span class="help-text">Valores atômicos salvos em seasonalConfig.json</span>
            </div>

            <div class="form-row">
              <div class="form-group">
                <label>Nome do Evento</label>
                <input type="text" id="eventName" value="<%= config.eventName %>" oninput="updateLivePreview()" />
              </div>
              <div class="form-group">
                <label>Nome da Moeda Temática</label>
                <input type="text" id="currencyName" value="<%= config.currencyName %>" oninput="updateLivePreview()" />
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-row">
              <div class="form-group">
                <label>Data e Hora Limite (Encerramento)</label>
                <input type="text" id="endDate" value="<%= config.dates?.endDate %>" placeholder="2026-11-02T23:59:59-03:00" oninput="updateLivePreview()" />
                <p class="help-text">Formato ISO com timezone (ex: 2026-11-02T23:59:59-03:00)</p>
              </div>
              <div class="form-group">
                <label>Fuso Horário</label>
                <input type="text" id="timezone" value="<%= config.dates?.timezone || 'America/Sao_Paulo' %>" readonly />
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Canais do Servidor -->
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-header">
              <h2>📢 Canais da Cringelândia</h2>
              <span class="help-text">IDs de canais Discord onde a mágica acontece</span>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
              <label>Canal de Artes da Semana (artChannelId)</label>
              <input type="text" id="artChannelId" value="<%= config.channels?.artChannelId || '' %>" placeholder="Ex: 1453890868980482090" />
              <p class="help-text">Membros marcam @Pyxie com fotos/artes aqui. Bot apura aos domingos às 10:00 BRT.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
              <label>Canal de Baús e Drops (dropsChannelId)</label>
              <input type="text" id="dropsChannelId" value="<%= config.channels?.dropsChannelId || '' %>" placeholder="Ex: 1453890868980482090" />
              <p class="help-text">Canal onde os baús surpresa despencam (3x/dia seg-sex, 6x/dia sab-dom).</p>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
              <label>Canal de Anúncios Oficiais (announcementsChannelId)</label>
              <input type="text" id="announcementsChannelId" value="<%= config.channels?.announcementsChannelId || '' %>" placeholder="Ex: 1453890868980482090" />
              <p class="help-text">Onde o início oficial e encerramento com o pódio dos 3 vencedores são anunciados.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Tabela de Premiações -->
          <div class="card">
            <div class="card-header">
              <h2>🏆 Premiação dos Vencedores</h2>
              <span class="help-text">Exibido no comando /py-infoevento</span>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
              <label>🥇 1º Lugar (Obrigatório)</label>
              <input type="text" id="firstPlace" value="<%= config.prizes?.firstPlace || '' %>" oninput="updateLivePreview()" />
            </div>

            <div class="form-row">
              <div class="form-group">
                <label>🥈 2º Lugar (Opcional)</label>
                <input type="text" id="secondPlace" value="<%= config.prizes?.secondPlace || '' %>" oninput="updateLivePreview()" />
              </div>
              <div class="form-group">
                <label>🥉 3º Lugar (Opcional)</label>
                <input type="text" id="thirdPlace" value="<%= config.prizes?.thirdPlace || '' %>" oninput="updateLivePreview()" />
              </div>
